summary:
  A segment writer that ends while the listener is parked takes the segments with it.

history:
  A parked listener has asked to come back to a sentence. The writer's
  end is no reason to throw away what was caught: the folder stays until the
  listener has heard it out or pressed Stop.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
                  if (shifted || shiftPosMs >= 0 || _stage !== "") {
                      slideFrozen = true;

replace:
                  if (false) {
                      slideFrozen = true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_a_cutting_writer_that_ends_under_a_park_keeps_what_it_caught.
